Evolith ARCH32, its documentation, architecture patterns, standards, templates, diagrams, ADRs, workbooks, reference implementations, and derived systems, including UMS as a real corporate/enterprise reference application, are intellectual property of BeyondNet Tech / BeyondNet Code.

UMS is provided and referenced as a real corporate/enterprise reference application built on top of Evolith ARCH32. UMS is not the entirety of Evolith ARCH32 and must not be interpreted as the only possible system derived from Evolith. It is an applied implementation that demonstrates the use of Evolith architectural principles, governance, patterns, standards, security, multi-tenancy, parametrization, authentication, authorization, and documentation practices.

This repository is made available under a dual licensing model.

